From: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:49:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] spi: Add the SPI master of the FonTamSOC

The SPI master of the FonTamSOC, driven through hwdrvchar.h, transfers
words of 4 bytes, mode 0, with one chip select: the transfers of a
message which the chip select spans are one transmission, polled. It
drives the SPI flash which holds the bitstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: William Tambe <tambewilliam@gmail.com>
